      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-mug-cake/#wprm-recipe-54619-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Keto-Pumpkin-Mug-Cake-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir to combine well.",
